### Rota Raiz do App
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Lista todos os Users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Insere um novo User
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tat",
  "email": "tatiana@example.com"
}

### Insere um novo User
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wladimir",
  "email": "wladimir@example.com"
}

### Lista um User específico
GET http://localhost:3000/users/689fd7fc-5abd-49da-bfba-317beb94d0d4


### Atualiza um User específico
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/689fd7fc-5abd-49da-bfba-317beb94d0d4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wladimir Santos",
  "email": "wladimir@example.com"
}

### Deleta um User específico
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/b52f7474-8e6c-465a-8b53-349d79ac120f
